# This repo preserves the SYSTEM: agents and skills (.claude/), tools/, docs/, CLAUDE.md, and a skeleton of
# each project (its README.md and macros/**/*.py). Sources (photos, CT scans, sketches, downloaded meshes),
# generated output (stl/, step/, renders/), vectors and working data stay on disk only (user decision
# 2026-09-25). See docs/architecture.md, "What the repo tracks".

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
# Local interpreter (docs/system.md, "Python environment")
/.venv/

# Inputs: never committed (includes raw, not de-identified CT panes and multi-GB downloaded meshes)
/sources/
/references/

# Projects: allowlist. Everything is ignored except each README.md, each STATE.md and the macros' Python code.
/projects/**
!/projects/**/
!/projects/**/README.md
!/projects/**/STATE.md
!/projects/**/macros/**/*.py
# ...but never rejected attempts (deleted on explicit user rejection, lesson recorded in the README;
# see docs/attempts.md)
/projects/**/attempts/

# Large working files, anywhere
*.npy
*.blend
*.blend1

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Temporary / scratchpad
/tmp/
